  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "We took the real Ballon d'Or top nine, added one more name, and let three rules decide. Spoiler: it's you.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "title",
        "heading": "TOP NINE + YOU",
        "sub": "Three rules. One winner.",
        "pill": "JUST FOR FUN",
        "person": "you"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Kane, Mbappé, Yamal, Rodri, Messi, Kvaratskhelia, Dembélé, Haaland, Olise. And at the bottom, you.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "list",
        "title": "Our ten",
        "rows": [
          {
            "name": "Harry Kane",
            "value": "1st",
            "club": "bay"
          },
          {
            "name": "Kylian Mbappé",
            "value": "2nd",
            "club": "rma"
          },
          {
            "name": "Lamine Yamal",
            "value": "3rd",
            "club": "bar"
          },
          {
            "name": "Rodri",
            "value": "4th",
            "club": "mci"
          },
          {
            "name": "Lionel Messi",
            "value": "5th",
            "club": "mia"
          },
          {
            "name": "Haaland and co",
            "value": "6th-9th"
          },
          {
            "name": "You",
            "value": "???",
            "club": "kib",
            "hl": true
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Rule one. You can't have won the Ballon d'Or already.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "text",
        "heading": "RULE 1",
        "body": "Must never have won the Ballon d'Or."
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Kane, Messi, Rodri and Dembélé have all won it. Four gone in one go.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "stamp",
        "text": "ALREADY WON",
        "person": "messi",
        "color": "yellow"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Rule two. You have to be under twenty-five.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "text",
        "heading": "RULE 2",
        "body": "Must be under twenty-five years old today."
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Mbappé is twenty-seven, Haaland twenty-six, Kvaratskhelia twenty-five. Out, out and out.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "stamp",
        "text": "TOO OLD",
        "person": "haaland",
        "color": "red"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Still standing: Lamine Yamal, Michael Olise, and somehow, you.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "versus",
        "title": "Still in",
        "left": {
          "person": "yamal",
          "label": "Yamal",
          "value": "19"
        },
        "right": {
          "person": "olise",
          "label": "Olise",
          "value": "24"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Rule three. And this one is completely made up. You must play Road to Ballon d'Or.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "text",
        "heading": "RULE 3",
        "body": "Just for fun: must play Road to Ballon d'Or. Yes, we made this one up."
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Yamal? Busy winning real trophies. Olise? Busy at Bayern. Neither of them has started a career.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "stamp",
        "text": "NO SAVE FILE",
        "person": "yamal",
        "color": "white"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Which leaves one name. Yours.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "person",
        "person": "you",
        "label": "THE LAST NAME LEFT",
        "mood": "shocked",
        "stamp": "WINNER"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Is it rigged? Completely. Will the real voters agree? Absolutely not.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "whatif",
        "title": "Real world v our world",
        "real": {
          "label": "Real Ballon d'Or",
          "value": "Kane"
        },
        "alt": {
          "label": "Our rules",
          "value": "YOU"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "But your player can still win it for real, inside the game.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "trophies",
        "items": [
          {
            "kind": "ballon",
            "label": "Ballon d'Or"
          },
          {
            "kind": "boot",
            "label": "Golden Boot"
          },
          {
            "kind": "bigears",
            "label": "Champions League"
          }
        ],
        "person": "you"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Follow for more, and play Road to Ballon d'Or at knowitball dot co dot uk.",
